        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAVENOUS is a first-person narrative psychological horror game, where you play as Louis, a child trapped in the depths of a basement designed by a monster who seems to know everything about you. You are alone. Trapped. And your little sister is waiting for you somewhere in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the cursed history of the White family through oppressive environments and solve puzzles to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras/c8f62d9a2ba98c21779f7bb3f503c342.avif?t=1755025342\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras_big/c8f62d9a2ba98c21779f7bb3f503c342.avif?t=1755025342 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a gloomy Victorian basement with unique rooms and atmospheres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious storyline filled with clues that take you to the heart of a family drama.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gameplay based on exploration and reflection: each room is a psychological puzzle to solve.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in French, English, and Korean, compatible with keyboard and XBOX controller.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE NIGHTMARE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are harmless. All you have is your intelligence, your courage, and the hope of seeing the light of day again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your sister, or lose yourself forever in this labyrinth shaped by grief and hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras/603245922325af00ba1a4ac1ae3eebc5.avif?t=1755025342\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras_big/603245922325af00ba1a4ac1ae3eebc5.webp?t=1755025342 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAVENOUS is a first-person narrative psychological horror game, where you play as Louis, a child trapped in the depths of a basement designed by a monster who seems to know everything about you. You are alone. Trapped. And your little sister is waiting for you somewhere in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the cursed history of the White family through oppressive environments and solve puzzles to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras/c8f62d9a2ba98c21779f7bb3f503c342.avif?t=1755025342\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras_big/c8f62d9a2ba98c21779f7bb3f503c342.avif?t=1755025342 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a gloomy Victorian basement with unique rooms and atmospheres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious storyline filled with clues that take you to the heart of a family drama.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gameplay based on exploration and reflection: each room is a psychological puzzle to solve.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in French, English, and Korean, compatible with keyboard and XBOX controller.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE NIGHTMARE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are harmless. All you have is your intelligence, your courage, and the hope of seeing the light of day again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your sister, or lose yourself forever in this labyrinth shaped by grief and hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873400/extras/603245922325af00ba1a4ac1ae3eebc5.avif?t=1